    <question_explanation no="17" id="PRB-9872F89136602CBD-Q17">
      <question_stem>자료 $( x_{i} , y_i )$ $( i = 1 , 2 , \ldots , 10 )$로부터 다음 결과를 얻었을 때, 이 자료를 최소제곱법으로 적합한 단순선형회귀식은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>자료</keyword>
        <keyword>로부터</keyword>
        <keyword>결과</keyword>
        <keyword>얻었</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>${\hat{y}} = - 1 + 2 x$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 통계학개론 · 회귀식의 추정
정답은 ①이다. β̂₁ = r × √(S_yy/S_xx) = (1/3) × √(36/1) = 2이고, β̂₀ = ȳ − β̂₁x̄ = 3 − 2 × 2 = −1이다. 따라서 ŷ = −1 + 2x이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>${\hat{y}} = - 1 + 2 x$</choice_text>
          <commentary>ŷ = −1 + 2x이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>${\hat{y}} = - 2 + x$</choice_text>
          <commentary>기울기와 절편이 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>${\hat{y}} = - 4 + 2 x$</choice_text>
          <commentary>절편이 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>${\hat{y}} = - 4 + x$</choice_text>
          <commentary>기울기와 절편이 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
